  "description": {
    "text": "Domino's Pizza's first Wakuwaku Pokémon Pack campaign ran in four rounds from 1 September 2008 to 15 January 2009: Munchlax in the first two, with a deck case and then a card file, Snorlax in the third, with a playmat and a beginner's book, and Snorlax LV.X in the fourth, with a deck case. The three cards make one evolution line, Munchlax and Snorlax drawn by Kagemaru Himeno and Snorlax LV.X by Shizurow.",
